refer to its panel, or \verb{@fig-sub-<observation_id>} to refer to one
observation. The generated caption is language-dependent; its English form
follows the pattern \verb{Bidens andicola ... observed in <locality> on dd/mm/yyyy, by <observer> (Licence: <photo licence>). <observation URL>}.
In Quarto or R Markdown, set \code{results: asis} on the chunk that calls
